WEBVTT

00:02:29.898 --> 00:02:31.466
Tap, tap ...

00:02:31.466 --> 00:02:32.567
tap, tap, tap.

00:02:33.135 --> 00:02:36.722
And I found it so relaxing
that I often fell asleep

00:02:36.722 --> 00:02:38.557
and never saw him finish the painting.

00:02:38.674 --> 00:02:39.675
(Laughter)

00:02:40.459 --> 00:02:46.198
In 2013, I learned that this special
response has a special name.

00:02:47.015 --> 00:02:51.219
Autonomous Sensory Meridian Response,

00:02:51.219 --> 00:02:53.789
or much more simply, ASMR.

00:02:55.540 --> 00:02:58.226
That is a complicated word,

00:02:58.226 --> 00:03:00.445
so it’s a good thing
we’ve got it simplified.